# DrafterBuckets-2 (2026-10-30): a DFlash2 context update's five kv matmuls (one per drafter layer, 768 x 4,096 4-bit at
# TP=3) run as ONE launch over the layers' kv matrices stacked side by side, at each layer's own split_k (8) and
# decode tile, so every column is the bits of its layer's own matmul (qmm.stack_parts / matmul_parts). Each layer's
# kv becomes a view into the stacked buffer (no extra memory). Default path: the decode rounds' taps graphs, the
# prompt chunks' update graphs, TF_GLM_DRAFT_WIDE's launches and the solo Drafter; bit-identical rings.
